  "authority": "xchain-documentation/protocol/test-vectors/anchor_canonical.json is authoritative. xchain-hub/test/fixtures and xchain-indexer/test/fixtures vendor byte-identical copies so each repo CI can assert without a sibling checkout. Keep all three identical.",
